    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "It was the tenth day of the fifth month of the seventh year of our exile. Some of the leaders of the Israelite community came to consult me about the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "'s will, and they sat down in front of me. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " spoke to me. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mortal man,” he said, “speak to these leaders and tell them that the Sovereign ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " is saying: you have come to ask my will, have you? As surely as I am the living God, I will not let you ask me anything. I, the Sovereign ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", have spoken.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Are you ready to pass sentence on them, mortal man? Then do so. Remind them of the disgusting things their ancestors did. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.6.2+EXO.6.3+EXO.6.4+EXO.6.5+EXO.6.6+EXO.6.7+EXO.6.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ex 6.2–8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tell them what I am saying. When I chose Israel, I made them a promise. I revealed myself to them in Egypt and told them: I am the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " your God. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "It was then that I promised to take them out of Egypt and lead them to a land I had chosen for them, a rich and fertile land, the finest land of all. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I told them to throw away the disgusting idols they loved and not to make themselves unclean with the false gods of Egypt, because I am the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " their God. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But they defied me and refused to listen. They did not throw away their disgusting idols or give up the Egyptian gods. I was ready to let them feel the full force of my anger there in Egypt. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But I did not, since that would have brought dishonour to my name, for in the presence of the people among whom they were living I had announced to Israel that I was going to lead them out of Egypt.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“And so I led them out of Egypt into the desert. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.18.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lev 18.5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I gave them my commands and taught them my laws, which bring life to anyone who obeys them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.31.13+EXO.31.14+EXO.31.15+EXO.31.16+EXO.31.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ex 31.13–17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I made the keeping of the Sabbath a sign of the agreement between us, to remind them that I, the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", make them holy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But even in the desert they defied me. They broke my laws and rejected my commands, which bring life to anyone who obeys them. They completely profaned the Sabbath. I was ready to let them feel the force of my anger there in the desert and destroy them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But I did not, since that would have brought dishonour to my name among the nations which had seen me lead Israel out of Egypt. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.14.26+NUM.14.27+NUM.14.28+NUM.14.29+NUM.14.30+NUM.14.31+NUM.14.32+NUM.14.33+NUM.14.34+NUM.14.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Num 14.26–35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So I made a promise in the desert that I would not take them to the land I had given them, a rich and fertile land, the finest land of all. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I made the promise because they had rejected my commands, broken my laws, and profaned the Sabbath — they preferred to worship their idols.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“But then I took pity on them. I decided not to kill them there in the desert. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Instead, I warned the young people among them: do not keep the laws your ancestors made; do not follow their customs or defile yourselves with their idols. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I am the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " your God. Obey my laws and my commands. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Make the Sabbath a holy day, so that it will be a sign of the covenant we made, and will remind you that I am the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " your God.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“But that generation also defied me. They broke my laws and did not keep my commands, which bring life to anyone who obeys them. They profaned the Sabbath. I was ready to let them feel the force of my anger there in the desert and kill them all. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But I did not, since that would have brought dishonour to my name among the nations which had seen me bring Israel out of Egypt. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.26.33"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lev 26.33",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So I made another promise in the desert. I vowed that I would scatter them all over the world. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I did this because they had rejected my commands, broken my laws, profaned the Sabbath, and worshipped the same idols their ancestors had served.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
