            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Then I gave them laws that are not good and commands that do not bring life. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I let them defile themselves with their own offerings, and I let them sacrifice their firstborn sons. This was to punish them and show them that I am the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Now then, mortal man, tell the Israelites what I, the Sovereign ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", am saying to them. This is another way their ancestors insulted me by their unfaithfulness. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I brought them to the land I had promised to give them. When they saw the high hills and green trees, they offered sacrifices at all of them. They made me angry by the sacrifices they burnt and by the wine they brought as offerings. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I asked them: what are these high places where you go? So they have been called ‘High Places’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20.29",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "high places",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": ": Pagan places of worship which the Hebrews were forbidden to use. The Hebrew word translated “High Places” sounds like the Hebrew for “where you go”.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ever since. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now tell the Israelites what I, the Sovereign ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", am saying: why must you commit the same sins your ancestors did and go running after their idols? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Even today you offer the same gifts and defile yourselves with the same idols by sacrificing your children to them in the fire. And then you Israelites still come to ask what my will is! As surely as I, the Sovereign ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", am the living God, I will not let you ask me anything. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You have made up your minds that you want to be like the other nations, like the people who live in other countries and worship trees and rocks. But that will never be.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“As surely as I, the Sovereign ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", am the living God, I warn you that in my anger I will rule over you with a strong hand, with all my power. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will show you my power and my anger when I gather you together and bring you back from all the countries where you have been scattered. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will bring you into the ‘Desert of the Nations’, and there I will condemn you to your face. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will now condemn you just as I condemned your ancestors in the Sinai Desert,” says the Sovereign ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“I will take firm control of you and make you obey my covenant. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will take away from among you those who are rebellious and sinful. I will take them out of the lands where they are living now, but I will not let them return to the land of Israel. Then you will know that I am the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ".”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The Sovereign ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said, “And now, all you Israelites, please yourselves! Go on and serve your idols! But I warn you that after this you will have to obey me and stop dishonouring my holy name by offering gifts to your idols. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "There in the land, on my holy mountain,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20.40",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "holy mountain",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": ": Mount Zion, the hill in Jerusalem which formed part of the Temple and palace area.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " the high mountain of Israel, all you people of Israel will worship me. I will be pleased with you and will expect you to bring me your sacrifices, your best offerings, and your holy gifts. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "After I bring you out of the countries where you have been scattered and gather you together, I will accept the sacrifices that you burn, and the nations will see that I am holy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When I bring you back to Israel, the land that I promised I would give to your ancestors, then you will know that I am the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then you will remember all the disgraceful things you did and how you defiled yourselves. You will be disgusted with yourselves because of all the evil things you did. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When I act to protect my honour, you Israelites will know that I am the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", because I do not deal with you as your wicked, evil actions deserve.” The Sovereign ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " has spoken.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.44"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " spoke to me. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mortal man,” he said, “look towards the south. Speak against the south and prophesy against the forest of the south. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tell the southern forest to hear what the Sovereign ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " is saying: look! I am starting a fire, and it will burn up every tree in you, whether green or dry. Nothing will be able to put it out. It will spread from south to north, and everyone will feel the heat of the flames. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They will all see that I, the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", set it on fire and that no one can put it out.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.48"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
